WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:05,250
We were the ones who were abrupt and we retreated

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:06,530
You tell me your conditions

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,410
I will not take the initiative to harm humans

4
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:09,850
Don't like to be disturbed either

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,810
Like the one who actively attacked me just now

6
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,130
I won't let it go either

7
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,530
Do you understand?

8
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,610
Got it, got it

9
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:17,010
I'll tell the leader when I get back

10
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,010
Won't bother you again

11
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,850
The Ji Chuan in front of me is an opportunity for me

12
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,890
Controlling him will establish my new status

13
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:23,610
My sister is just a control tool

14
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:26,010
Monsters like Ji Chuan are the top combat power

15
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:28,370
Lorna's control requires close touch

16
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:32,190
But I'm not the same sister

17
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:39,780
My telekinesis is the most powerful

18
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,420
I said I won't let go of those who attack me
